    "鬧鐘響這麼久還沒被關掉，就自動停止並讓螢幕休眠，避免小孩不在時一直耗電。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "If the alarm keeps ringing this long without being turned off, it stops automatically and lets the screen sleep — so it won't drain the battery while your child is away."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "鬧鐘響這麼久還沒被關掉，就自動停止並讓螢幕休眠，避免小孩不在時一直耗電。"
